TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="tests/**, test_*.py, *_test.py"

TEST_COMMAND:
- uv run pytest tests/ -q
- uv run pytest --cov=src --cov-report=term-missing for coverage

TEST_CONVENTIONS:
- Test files: test_<module>.py mirroring src/ layout
- Test functions: test_<what_it_does> — full sentence in name preferred
- Fixtures in conftest.py at appropriate scope level
- Use pytest.mark for slow/integration tests: @pytest.mark.integration

COVERAGE_REQUIREMENTS:
- (fill in — e.g., "no hard threshold" or "80% line coverage minimum")

FORBIDDEN_IN_TESTS:
- No real network calls — use responses or httpx mock
- No real filesystem writes outside tmp_path fixture
- No skipped tests without a comment and tracking issue
